{"symbol":"ADMACH","yahoo":"ADMACH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Admach Systems Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","website":"https://www.admach.co.in","about":"Admach Systems Limited designs, develops, manufactures, exports, and installs customized special purpose machinery and advanced industrial systems for the engineering industry in India and internationally. It provides special purpose machines, automation systems, assembly machines, packaging machines, product design services, and robotic material handling systems. The company's products include black bar solutions, bar chamfering machines, bar straightening machines, bright bar solutions, grinding solutions, super-finishing solutions, MPI systems, bar and billet conditioning lines, bright bar handling systems, and secondary packaging products. It also offers pipe industry solutions, including offline welding, pipe transportation, real-time radiography, SAW pipe cleaning, ultrasonic testing, X-ray cabinet systems, and customized cabinet systems; and equipment for the alloy steel industry, such as pipe rotators and lifters and UT-MFL systems. In addition, the company provides after-sales support services, including maintenance, repair, and technical services. It serves the defense, nuclear and atomic energy, aerospace, mining, steel, automobile, food processing, tooling, and advanced engineering industries. The company was formerly known as Admach Systems Private Limited and changed its name to Admach Systems Limited in October 2024. It was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:06:13+00:00","quote":{"price":475.0,"prevClose":474.5,"marketCap":321.72,"high52":482.95,"low52":179.0,"pe":25.8,"bookValue":104.0,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":21.65,"shares":0.6773,"insiders":68.3,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-12-31","2026-01-01","2026-01-02","2026-01-05","2026-01-06","2026-01-07","2026-01-08","2026-01-09","2026-01-12","2026-